{{!-- "Forgot password". Data: resetUrl, ttlMinutes --}}
{{> heading text="Reset your password"}}
{{#> para}}Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the password for your {{site.name}} account.{{/para}}

{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}

{{#> para small=true}}This link works once and expires in {{ttlMinutes}} minutes. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email: your password won't change.{{/para}}

<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid {{theme.border}};margin:22px 0">
{{#> para small=true}}Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:<br><a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color:{{theme.primary}};word-break:break-all">{{resetUrl}}</a>{{/para}}
